# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Lock files (never change, never need context)
**/package-lock.json
**/go.sum
**/poetry.lock
**/Cargo.lock

# Build output
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/build/
**/target/

# Binary / compiled
**/bin/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Stale branches
**/.worktrees/

# IDE / cache
**/.superpowers/
**/.claude/agents/
**/node_modules/.cache

# Test coverage / reports
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/htmlcov/

# Env files (security + noise)
**/.env*
!**/.env.example

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/

# Terraform state / cache
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup

# Docker layer cache
**/.dockercache/

# OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
